{"availability":"available","full":"WingsDevelopment/wagmi-extended","name":"wagmi-extended","description":"wagmi-extended","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":24,"forks":0,"created":"2025-04-09T16:33:44Z","updated":"2025-12-22T13:49:59Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://buymeacoffee.com/srdjanr160n","topics":["react","transaction-receipt","wagmi","wagmi-extended","wagmi-extra","wagmi-utils","wagmiextended","waiting-for-receipt"],"demo":"https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/5jr3lg","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:12:39.239Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:12:39.239Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:12:39.239Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:44:05.635Z","stars":24,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:12:39.239Z","stars":24,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["wagmi-extended is a powerful library that builds on Wagmi, Viem, and TanStack Query to deliver extended hooks and helper functions for Ethereum and blockchain development with React.","It simplifies tasks like fetching token metadata, handling ERC20 approvals, sending transactions, writing contracts and getting user friendly error message from ABIs.","Our library adheres to one core principle: always wait for a transaction receipt. This guarantees that your dApps capture transaction outcomes reliably—no manual state management or race conditions required."],"features":["React Query caching: results stored under the key","[\"deploymentBlock\", chainId, address.toLowerCase(), floor].","LocalStorage caching (browser only):","On the first run, the block is computed and stored in both React Query and localStorage.","On subsequent runs, the value is read from localStorage to fully prevent RPC refetches."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WingsDevelopment/wagmi-extended/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ed060d18536c904b546c6a7ec115f65758dc46199bb7d9eda04d195e4d89b918","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:05.722Z"},"overviewCh